  scenarioTitle: Appointment Reminder
  introNarration: You booked a GP appointment yesterday. A reminder just came in.
  senderName: HotDoc
  messageBody: 'Reminder: GP appointment tomorrow at 10:00am, Deakin Health Clinic,
    Waurn Ponds. Call 03 5227 8500 to reschedule. Do not reply to this SMS.'
